@scenario tutorial_topics
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[if !tutorial_count]
[set tutorial_count 0]
[endif]
[show ginger topics shy]
ginger: I'm Ginger. This little studio is yours to experiment in. Pick something you'd like to try and I'll show you how it works.
@label topics
[show ginger topics normal]
> Writing and branching -> topics_page_1
> Characters and backgrounds -> topics_page_2
> Animation, audio and lighting -> topics_page_3
> Text and interfaces -> topics_page_4
> Game systems -> topics_page_5
> Testing and editor tools -> topics_page_6
> Progress and motion -> options
> Finish for now -> goodbye
@label goodbye
[show ginger guide shy]
ginger: Thanks for keeping me company. When you have a scene of your own, try changing just one line and see what happens.
[mainmenu story/tutorial_hub.vns]
[end]
@label options
ginger: You have completed ${tutorial_count} of 30 topics. You can replay any example.
> Use reduced motion -> still
> Enable movement -> motion
> All topics -> topics
@label still
[flag tutorial_still]
[set ui.reduceMotion true]
[jump topics]
@label motion
[set tutorial_still false]
[set ui.reduceMotion false]
[jump topics]
@label topics_page_1
[bg room]
[show ginger topics thoughtful]
> Dialogue -> open_dialogue
> Pauses and timing -> open_narration
> Variables and conditions -> open_variables
> Choices and labels -> open_menus
> Subroutines -> open_subroutines
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_2
[bg room]
[show ginger topics thoughtful]
> Expressions -> open_expressions
> Backgrounds -> open_images
> Transitions -> open_transitions
> Character movement -> open_movement
> Camera movement -> open_camera
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_3
[bg room]
[show ginger topics thoughtful]
> Sound effects -> open_audio
> Puppeteer timelines -> open_puppeteer
> Sprite effects -> open_plugins_and_line_boil
> Particles -> open_particles_and_visualizers
> Stage lighting -> open_layer_groups_and_lighting
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_4
[bg room]
[show ginger topics thoughtful]
> Localization -> open_localization
> Dialogue layout -> open_ui_layout
> Dialogue and narration -> open_dialogue_presentation
> Reactive UI -> open_reactive_ui_and_facets
> Phone messages -> open_phone_storytelling
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_5
[bg room]
[show ginger topics thoughtful]
> Opening a JES scene -> open_vns_jes
> Saving and rollback -> open_saves_rollback_persistence
> Editing JES entities -> open_jes_entities_input_widgets
> Collision shapes -> open_jes_worlds_physics_rpg
> Combining systems -> open_java_extensions_and_capstone
> All topics -> topics
@label topics_page_6
[bg room]
[show ginger topics thoughtful]
> Debugging a scene -> open_best_practices
> Testing a build -> open_testing_release
> Previewing an edit -> open_editor_workflows
> Rendering performance -> open_assets_and_performance
> Reduced motion -> open_accessibility_and_controls
> All topics -> topics
@label open_dialogue
[goto T01_Dialogue:start]
@label open_narration
[goto T02_Narration:start]
@label open_expressions
[goto T03_Expressions:start]
@label open_images
